    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55117" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασῐωπ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>keep silence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				8.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1413b7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				2.33
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰδότες κ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				14.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					41.23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc. rei,
				<i>keep silent, pass over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γεγονός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					32.10
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>condemn by silence</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					32.98
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> causal,
				<i>make silent, silence</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γυναῖκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.4.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
			</span></i><i>Bis Acc.</i><i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Anach.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Dom.</u>
				16
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>cause silence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.4.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασιωπήσασθαι διὰ τοῦ σαλπιγκτοῦ τὸν
					θόρυβον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					18.46.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
